/// <h1>Log</h1>
/// Lightweight logging utility that prints tagged messages with a severity prefix.
/// important:
/// Deprecated. <code>IosLibrary</code> itself no longer uses <code>Log</code>: it logs through
/// <code>os.Logger</code> (subsystem <code>com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary</code>, one category per type),
